      "id": "claim_9835831b231f4c22976859931dddc350",
      "statement": "planDaemonInstall supports only darwin and linux, creates ~/.brijio with a 0600 .env that persistently holds generated BRIJIO_PAIRING_TOKEN and MCP_HTTP_AUTH_TOKEN (idempotent on reinstall), writes a binary wrapper to ~/.brijio/bin/brijio, builds a com.redvex.brijio LaunchAgent plist (RunAtLoad/KeepAlive, .env as single source of truth) or systemd user unit (Restart=on-failure, EnvironmentFile), and symlinks it into ~/Library/LaunchAgents or ~/.config/systemd/user; uninstall stops/unloads and removes the symlink but preserves ~/.brijio.",
